%% 迭代 2 时序图（新增/变更链路）
%% ① FR-11 语音生成端到端 ② FR-09 执行性幻觉泄漏拦截（对外泄漏=0）

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 微信用户
    participant CB as WechatCallbackController
    participant WM as WechatMessageService
    participant ORCH as AgentOrchestratorImpl
    participant LLM as LlmClientRouter
    participant TTS as SynthesizeVoiceTool
    participant VS as VoiceSynthesisPort
    participant TC as MediaTranscodeService
    participant MD as MediaDispatchPort
    participant CC as ConsistencyChecker
    participant FB as FallbackService
    participant LOG as ToolCallLogService

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    note over U,LOG: ① FR-11 语音生成端到端（Mock 可验收）
    U->>CB: 语音消息/文本"读给我听"
    CB->>WM: handleInboundWithReceipt
    WM->>ORCH: run(OrchestrationRequest)
    ORCH->>LLM: chat(tools=enabledSchemas)
    LLM-->>ORCH: toolCalls=[synthesize_voice]
    ORCH->>LOG: logStart(traceId,...,synthesize_voice)
    ORCH->>TTS: execute(ctx, args)
    TTS->>VS: synthesize(text, voiceId)
    VS-->>TTS: byte[] (MockTtsClient)
    TTS->>TC: transcode(byte[], amr)
    TC-->>TTS: amr bytes (ffmpeg)
    TTS->>MD: sendVoice(openid, amr, file)
    MD-->>TTS: MediaId
    TTS-->>ORCH: ToolResult.success("已生成语音")
    ORCH->>LOG: logEnd(record, SUCCESS)
    ORCH->>CC: check(reply, executed)
    CC-->>ORCH: passed
    ORCH-->>WM: OrchestrationResult(文本回执)
    WM->>CB: 异步推送(文本+语音)
    end

    rect rgb(255,240,235)
    note over U,LOG: ② FR-09 执行性幻觉泄漏拦截（工具全失败，模型声称成功）
    U->>CB: "查下我的快递到哪了"
    CB->>WM: handleInboundWithReceipt
    WM->>ORCH: run(OrchestrationRequest)
    ORCH->>LLM: chat(tools)
    LLM-->>ORCH: toolCalls=[query_express]
    ORCH->>LOG: logStart(traceId,...,query_express)
    ORCH->>TTS: (示例) QueryExpressTool.execute
    Note over TTS: ExpressQueryPort 调用超时/失败
    TTS-->>ORCH: ToolResult.failure("TOOL_FAILED")
    ORCH->>LOG: logEnd(record, FAILED)
    ORCH->>LLM: chat(终态文本)
    LLM-->>ORCH: "你的快递已签收，明天送达"（编造）
    ORCH->>CC: check(reply, executed)
    CC->>CC: ActionClaimExtractor.extract("已签收")
    CC->>CC: findSupporting → 无 SUCCESS 记录
    CC-->>ORCH: ConsistencyVerdict.unsupported(claim, traceId)
    ORCH->>FB: render(EXECUTION_HALLUCINATION)
    FB-->>ORCH: "抱歉，我暂时无法获取该项信息"
    ORCH-->>WM: OrchestrationResult(fallback, 含 traceId)
    Note over ORCH,LOG: 日志含 traceId，对外泄漏=0（PRD KR2 / FR-09 验收②）
    end
